# Every file needs a reviewer. Order matters: the last matching rule wins.
#
# NOTE FOR THE MAINTAINER: replace @OWNER with the real GitHub handle before
# enabling branch protection. CODEOWNERS silently does nothing if the handle
# does not exist or lacks write access -- it fails open, so a wrong handle looks
# identical to a working one until a review is silently not requested.

* @OWNER

# Anything that can publish, weaken a gate, or change what ships is
# security-sensitive and must never be self-merged without review.
/.github/workflows/   @OWNER
/.github/CODEOWNERS   @OWNER
/scripts/             @OWNER
/pyproject.toml       @OWNER
/uv.lock              @OWNER
/LICENSE              @OWNER
/NOTICE               @OWNER
